 you already have without writing them down. The rest of the tree still waits for the end of a run.the legacy perks you picked for this run sit on the Soulstone. Hover one to see what it does.press Space to bring your","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T15:34:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674676","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599480-1845383656378648","game_id":"steam-4599480","kind":"update","title":"Demo update - v0.6.0","summary":"Addedlegacy perks: every class and pet form you've discovered now becomes a perk for later worlds. When you begin a new journey, a pack shows what you've unlocked and you pick perks for your slots. They last until your next journey. The Elder also adds a Dungeon Core to the seal's reward: offer it to the Soulstone for an Echo, and spend Echoes on extra slots, more cards to pick from, or a redraw.words before battle: the quest bosses on floors 5, 10 and 20 now have something to say before the fig","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T18:42:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656378648","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599480-1843481262698970","game_id":"steam-4599480","kind":"update","title":"Demo update - v0.5.0","summary":"Addedevery craft is a cinematic now — ingredients drift together, squash on contact, flash, and the result bursts out in a shower of sparkscraft a known tier-2 straight from raw materials in the recipe book, and watch the whole tree resolve in one go: resources into both halves, halves into the weaponfirst crafts stage their stats in one at a time at the end of the merge, rather than in a separate windowrepeat crafts run short and collect themselves — spam-crafting is still one clickstun runs on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T07:41:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262698970","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599480-1835871199311340","game_id":"steam-4599480","kind":"update","title":"Demo update - v0.4.2","summary":"Fixedthe board no longer shoves your cards around. Dropping a card, gathering, crafting, or sending your character off to a deposit settles the new card into the nearest open spot and leaves everything already placed exactly where you left it. Pets weave around obstacles to reach what they're after — and if one gets truly hemmed in, it pauses with a \"?\" then hops over. Fights start cleanly beside your character, and story cards drop into open space of their own instead of pushing the rest of the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-21T17:26:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199311340","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599480-1834602721193794","game_id":"steam-4599480","kind":"update","title":"Demo update - v0.4.0","summary":"AddedResearch Table — combine two discovered ingredients to instantly unlock a new recipe, sealed with a gacha-style reveal. T1 weapons and base ingredients now carry a small indicator so you can see what's worth experimenting with.resource markers — use up the last of a resource pile and a faded marker keeps its spot. Newly gathered, looted, or crafted resources of that kind return there on their own, so your \"wood here, stone there\" layout survives a pile running dry. Drop a card on a marker t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T13:23:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721193794","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599480-1832065502808899","game_id":"steam-4599480","kind":"update","title":"Demo update - v0.3.1","summary":"Fixedfixed village inventory getting stuck holding items (affected saves auto-heal on load)fixed juvenile pets getting stuck below evolution threshold when prestige mastery reduces itfixed equipped weapon appearing as a stray card on the far zoom layer","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-06T13:27:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502808899","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599480-1831432155573819","game_id":"steam-4599480","kind":"update","title":"Demo update - v0.3.0","summary":"Addedpets autonomously harvest deposits and fight enemies, with a target indicator showing where they're headingpet stamina system: autonomous actions cost stamina, refilled by feedingnew-game screen transition with initial zoom-in animationavailable quests now ripple and wiggle to stand out from active onesdungeon floor information added to the first dungeon quest descriptiont1 and t2 weapons added to grave dropsbrighter soulstone highlight when dragging cardsFixedfixed talking NPC not acceptin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-02T13:55:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155573819","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599480-1830797770236833","game_id":"steam-4599480","kind":"update","title":"Demo update - v0.2.0","summary":"Addedadded versioning systemimproved versioning systemdistance-based card viewadded true fullscreen modeadded changelog modalFixedadded missing icons for coconut and wild rootfixed activity log item max height issue, that cut text verticallyfixed tiny artifact in one russian localization string of village inventory placeholderfixed deposit progress bar right padding","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-24T17:00:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770236833","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599480-1830163047269051","game_id":"steam-4599480","kind":"announcement","title":"Hi","summary":"Hi.I'm sshulin and I'm making Soulstack. This is a card stacker, and there are maybe 9 games in the genre on Steam total. Stacklands at the top with 11k+ reviews. WitchHand and Card Cultivation pulled off their launches after it. The rest got abandoned or went free. Stacks:Space and Stacks:Jungle went free. Card Age got delisted. Most attempts haven't cleared 100 reviews. So I know what I'm walking into, and I'm taking the shot anyway because I like the genre and think there's room for a version","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-21T16:34:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047269051","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4599480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:14Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:14Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4599480":"2026-10-26T12:55:14Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4599480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:14Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:14Z","st